  it fire. (Option A would have been deleting the dead gate — rejected; we want it live.)
- **I-3:** NaN k* guard in `ObservationWindow.Add`.
- **I-2:** shared `validITLModel(A,B)` helper used by both `FitITLModel` and `resolveITLModel`.
- **I-4:** NaN / k*>1 guards in `computeLocalDemand`.
- Each with a focused test. All four are I-2/I-3/I-4/I-6 from TA-forward-plan.md.
